{"seq":3,"slug":"related-party-transfer-pricing","title":"关联方交易与转让定价的估价衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/customs-valuation-mechanism/related-party-transfer-pricing","wordCount":3299,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"关联方交易与转让定价的估价衔接\">关联方交易与转让定价的估价衔接</h1><p>同一批货物从境外关联公司进口，财务部按集团转让定价政策定价，海关则要求申报&quot;实付或应付价格&quot;是否受关联关系影响。两边看同一条流水，却用两套语言：税务问&quot;是否符合独立交易原则&quot;，海关问&quot;关系是否影响了价格&quot;。一份转让定价报告可以证明毛利落在四分位区间内，却仍可能在海关被否定——因为海关不接受可比公司数据库作为直接依据，它要的是<strong>这笔交易本身</strong>的价格证据。本文拆解两套体系如何对接、在哪些点分叉，以及如何用一套可复算的数据同时满足双方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解关联交易估价衔接要先分清三件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两套问题不是一个测试</strong>：税务转让定价问「价格是否符合独立交易原则」（基于可比公司毛利），海关估价问「关联关系是否影响了这笔交易的成交价格」（基于交易本身证据），一份转让定价报告通过税务测试不等于通过海关测试。</li>\n<li><strong>两条可接受路径</strong>：海关可经「情形检验」（审查交易环境与定价过程）或「测试价格检验」（与海关掌握的可比成交价比对）接受成交价格，举证口径与税务文档不同。</li>\n<li><strong>权利金是连接点</strong>：关联方间支付的特许权使用费既要按转让定价判断独立费率，又要按 WTO 估价协定第 8.1(c) 条判断是否加计入完税价格，需要一套可同时复算的数据。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误解</strong>：以为「落在四分位区间内」海关就必然认可；实际上海关不直接采信可比公司数据库，它要的是本笔交易定价未受关系影响的证据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关联关系的法定界定与成交价格的可用性\">关联关系的法定界定与成交价格的可用性</h2><p>先要回答的是：谁算&quot;关联方&quot;。WTO《海关估价协定》（《1994 年关税与贸易总协定》第七条实施协定）第 15 条以列举方式界定关联关系，涵盖：一方担任另一方的董事或高管、双方为法律上的商业合伙人、一方是另一方的雇主或雇员、任一方直接或间接持有、控制或共同持有对方 <strong>5% 以上有表决权股票</strong>，以及双方同受第三方控制或同属一个家族（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_info_e.htm\">WTO Customs Valuation technical information</a>）。注意 5% 这条：转让定价税制里通常以 25% 持股或实质控制为门槛，海关的起算点低得多——很多在税务上&quot;不构成关联方&quot;的少数股权交易，在海关口径下已经落入关联范畴。</p>\n<p>但<strong>关联关系本身不等于成交价格不可用</strong>。协定第 1.2 条给出两条并行的通过路径，满足其一即可继续用成交价格法（Method 1）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(a) 情形检验（circumstances of sale）</strong>——进口方能证明&quot;关系没有影响价格&quot;；</li>\n<li><strong>(b) 测试价格检验（test values）</strong>——成交价格<strong>非常接近</strong>一个测试价格（同一时期向无关联买方销售的相同或类似货物价格、或按 deductive/computed 方法得出的价格）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第 1.2 条的程序设计对进口方有利：海关若怀疑价格受关系影响，必须先说明具体理由，给进口方&quot;合理的时间&quot;回应，并就最终决定出具书面说明（协定第 17 条及第 1.2 条附注）。一份有说服力的反证在被正式否定前，有法定的陈述空间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[关联方之间进口货物] --&gt; B{申报成交价格}&#10;    B --&gt; C{买卖双方是否第15条意义下的关联方?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| Z1[直接适用成交价格法]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D{能否证明关系未影响价格?}&#10;    D --&gt;|情形检验通过| Z2[接受成交价格]&#10;    D --&gt;|不确定| E{能否找到测试价格?}&#10;    E --&gt;|成交价格接近测试价格| Z2&#10;    E --&gt;|无法接近| F[转用方法 2-6 顺序估价]&#10;    F --&gt; G[相同/类似货物成交价]&#10;    G --&gt; H[扣除价格 / 计算价格]&#10;    H --&gt; I[合理方法 fallback]\">flowchart TD\n    A[关联方之间进口货物] --&gt; B{申报成交价格}\n    B --&gt; C{买卖双方是否第15条意义下的关联方?}\n    C --&gt;|否| Z1[直接适用成交价格法]\n    C --&gt;|是| D{能否证明关系未影响价格?}\n    D --&gt;|情形检验通过| Z2[接受成交价格]\n    D --&gt;|不确定| E{能否找到测试价格?}\n    E --&gt;|成交价格接近测试价格| Z2\n    E --&gt;|无法接近| F[转用方法 2-6 顺序估价]\n    F --&gt; G[相同/类似货物成交价]\n    G --&gt; H[扣除价格 / 计算价格]\n    H --&gt; I[合理方法 fallback]</pre><h2 id=\"情形检验-到底看什么-把转让定价文档翻译成海关证据\">「情形检验」到底看什么：把转让定价文档翻译成海关证据</h2><p>情形检验的核心问题是：买方支付的价格，是否与&quot;向无关联卖方购买同一货物时会支付的价格&quot;一致。这一点与转让定价税制的独立交易原则表面上同源，实则举证材料几乎不重叠。</p>\n<p>税务要的是一份可比性分析——选取可比公司、计算营业利润率或成本加成率、判断落在中位数的哪个位置。海关通常<strong>不承认可比公司数据库</strong>作为直接证据，因为海关核的是<strong>具体这笔交易</strong>的价格是否被关系扭曲，而不是整体利润水平是否合理。协定第 1.2 条的附注提示了一条更接近海关语境的路径：审查<strong>交易是如何达成的</strong>——定价是否遵循公司正常的定价政策、价格是否覆盖全部成本并带来利润、货物是否按卖方向无关联买方销售的同样条件提供。</p>\n<p>这给了实操一个清晰的转换规则：把转让定价文档从&quot;结论证明&quot;降格为&quot;事实来源&quot;。海关关心的是文档中这几类可核验事实：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转让定价文档中的内容</th>\n<th>海关是否直接采信</th>\n<th>海关真正要看的事实</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可比公司利润率中位数</td>\n<td>通常不采信</td>\n<td>卖方对所有买方（含无关联买方）是否用同一价格表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能风险分析（DEMPE）</td>\n<td>仅作背景</td>\n<td>买方是否承担了本该由卖方承担的职能，从而有权压价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价政策文件</td>\n<td>部分采信</td>\n<td>定价政策是否先于交易存在、是否被一致执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联交易明细与毛利</td>\n<td>部分采信</td>\n<td>同批货物向无关联第三方的实际售价是否可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预约定价安排（APA）</td>\n<td>不自动采信</td>\n<td>海关是否参与该 APA 或出具过对应价格预裁定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OECD《跨国企业与税务机关转让定价指南》第六章把无形资产的收益归属绑定到 <strong>DEMPE 职能</strong>（开发、增值、维护、保护、利用）上（<a href=\"https://www.oecd.org/en/topics/transfer-pricing.html\">OECD Transfer Pricing Guidelines</a>）。海关会借用这套语言做反向推断：如果境外关联卖方在集团内不承担任何 DEMPE 职能，却向境内买方收取高额技术许可费，海关更有理由怀疑这笔许可费抬高了货物完税价格，进而审查其是否构成销售条件（判定链条见同章 <a href=\"royalty-condition-of-sale\">特许权使用费与「销售条件」判定</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试价格与二次检验-可复算的量化门槛\">测试价格与二次检验：可复算的量化门槛</h2><p>当情形检验讲不清时，测试价格是更硬的抓手。做法是把申报的关联成交价与一组独立参照价格比对，落在容差内即通过。协定第 1.2 条附注把它描述为&quot;非常接近&quot;，并把选择参照价格时的几点因素列出：相同/类似货物的销售在商业水平、数量、时间上是否足以比较，是否存在足以解释价格差异的显著差别。</p>\n<p>设关联成交价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，测试价格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，容差阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，通过条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>δ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟺</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left| V_r - V_t \\right| / V_t \\le \\delta \\quad \\Longleftrightarrow \\quad V_r \\in \\left[ V_t(1-\\delta),\\; V_t(1+\\delta) \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 没有全球统一值，由各法域自行确定或在个案中协商；关键不在于公式本身，而在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须来自<strong>可核验的独立交易</strong>，而不是另一笔同样关联的交易。</p>\n<p>一个容易踩的坑：测试价格检验是把关联价与<strong>独立价</strong>比，不是与集团转让定价政策的&quot;目标价&quot;比。后者是税务口径的产物，在海关看来只是又一份关联方自己出具的文件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中国的衔接路径-213-号令-价格预裁定与同期资料\">中国的衔接路径：213 号令、价格预裁定与同期资料</h2><p>中国把这两条路径落在《中华人民共和国海关审定进出口货物完税价格办法》（海关总署令第 213 号）下。该办法确立了关联交易申报义务：存在关联关系的，纳税义务人应在申报时填报关联关系，并在海关要求时提供价格未受影响的证明。</p>\n<p>中国实务里，把海关口径与税务口径真正打通的是两个工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>价格预裁定（price pre-ruling）</strong>：进口前提交合同、定价政策、可比交易资料与分摊方案，海关出具具有约束力的估价意见，把&quot;价格是否被接受&quot;变成前置确认。对结构复杂、金额大的关联交易，这是成本最低的风险出清方式。</li>\n<li><strong>转让定价同期资料的双向使用</strong>：本地文档中的关联交易明细、定价政策、功能风险分析可作为预裁定附件提交，但海关仍独立核查独立交易证据，而非直接认可税务结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需留意中国近年推动的<strong>海关与税务协同</strong>方向：在同期资料与预裁定之间建立一致的事实基础，避免&quot;税务认可、海关否定&quot;的分叉。落地程度因关区而异，企业不应假设一份税务 APA 就能自动通过海关审查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个可执行的对账模型\">一个可执行的对账模型</h2><p>把上述规则做成一张可复算的表，才能在申报时快速定位风险点。核心是同时比对三个比值：费价比、毛利率差、以及与独立价的偏离度。</p>\n<p>设某批次货物申报价（CIF）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，当期支付的可计入特许权使用费为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，集团转让定价政策目标利润率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实际毛利率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，独立交易参照价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。四个诊断量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi = \\frac{R}{C}, \\qquad \\Delta m = m - m^*, \\qquad \\varepsilon = \\frac{\\left| C - V_t \\right|}{V_t}, \\qquad \\tau = \\frac{C}{C + R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是货物价格在&quot;货物 + 许可费&quot;总对价中的占比，用于判断若许可费被加计，完税价格将上升多少。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 长期稳定且与货值同向变动，支持&quot;许可费与货物挂钩&quot;的事实认定；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 大幅偏离政策目标，可能说明价格被人为压低或抬高；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 0，测试价格检验越容易通过。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[关联进口批次] --&gt; B[计算费价比 phi = R / C]&#10;    A --&gt; C[计算毛利率偏离 Delta_m]&#10;    A --&gt; D[计算与独立价偏离 epsilon]&#10;    B --&gt; E{phi 是否长期稳定且随货值同向?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[许可费倾向计入 需分摊]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[许可费可能与货物脱钩]&#10;    C --&gt; H{|Delta_m| 是否超阈值?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[价格可能被关系影响 触发情形检验]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[支持关系未影响价格]&#10;    D --&gt; K{epsilon &lt;= delta?}&#10;    K --&gt;|是| L[测试价格检验通过]&#10;    K --&gt;|否| M[转用方法 2-6]\">flowchart TD\n    A[关联进口批次] --&gt; B[计算费价比 phi = R / C]\n    A --&gt; C[计算毛利率偏离 Delta_m]\n    A --&gt; D[计算与独立价偏离 epsilon]\n    B --&gt; E{phi 是否长期稳定且随货值同向?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[许可费倾向计入 需分摊]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[许可费可能与货物脱钩]\n    C --&gt; H{|Delta_m| 是否超阈值?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[价格可能被关系影响 触发情形检验]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[支持关系未影响价格]\n    D --&gt; K{epsilon &lt;= delta?}\n    K --&gt;|是| L[测试价格检验通过]\n    K --&gt;|否| M[转用方法 2-6]</pre><p>这套量化不只是内部风控，它同时是应对海关质疑的举证骨架：结论能被数字重放，比定性说明更抗辩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与操作清单\">常见误区与操作清单</h2><p>高频误判集中在几处：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>&quot;有转让定价文档就等于海关过关&quot;。</strong> 税务文档证明的是利润归属合理，不能直接证明具体成交价未被关系影响；两者是不同命题。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;5% 门槛太高，我们不构成关联方&quot;。</strong> 海关关联门槛常低于税务门槛，少数股权、家族关系、共同高管都可能触发申报义务。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;用另一笔关联交易的价格做测试价格&quot;。</strong> 测试价格必须来自独立交易，关联价对关联价不构成检验。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;APA 签了，海关自然会认&quot;。</strong> 除非海关参与或另有价格预裁定，税务 APA 不自动产生海关约束力。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;预裁定只在出问题时才申请&quot;。</strong> 它的价值在于进口前定位，事后申请已错过窗口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>操作上可遵循的顺序：进口前完成关联关系判定与情形检验自评，形成&quot;定价政策—独立交易参照—功能风险&quot;三段式证据；对金额大或结构复杂的交易申请价格预裁定；建立关联交易台账，按批次记录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 三个诊断量并与申报数据对账。费率建模口径见 <a href=\"../licensing-royalty-model/royalty-base-and-rate-model\">特许权使用费基数与费率模型</a>，合同条款如何影响关联价格认定见 <a href=\"../licensing-royalty-model/license-contract-terms-model\">许可合同条款建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>海关与转让定价是两套平行体系：税务问&quot;是否符合独立交易原则&quot;，海关问&quot;关系是否影响了这笔价格&quot;；一份转让定价报告不能自动通过海关审查。</li>\n<li>关联关系由 WTO 估价协定第 15 条界定，含 <strong>5% 表决权持股</strong>等低门槛情形；关联不等于成交价格不可用。</li>\n<li>第 1.2 条给出两条通过路径：<strong>情形检验</strong>与<strong>测试价格检验</strong>，且进口方享有知情、回应与磋商的程序保障。</li>\n<li>情形检验看的是<strong>交易如何达成</strong>——定价政策是否一致执行、是否覆盖成本并获利、是否向无关联买方提供同样条件，而非可比公司利润率中位数。</li>\n<li>中国以 213 号令落地，<strong>价格预裁定</strong>与<strong>转让定价同期资料</strong>是打通两条口径的关键工具，但海关独立核查独立交易证据。</li>\n<li>量化抓手是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>：结论要能被数字复算，才在举证时站得住。</li>\n<li>WCO 技术委员会 2025 年第 60 届会议（4 月 7–11 日）通过<strong>两份转让定价案例研究</strong>与一份买方未付款咨询意见，第 61 届会议（10 月 23 日）通过关于&quot;实付或应付价格&quot;的新文书，规则工具仍在演进（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/valuation/news.aspx\">WCO Valuation News</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关联方交易与转让定价的估价衔接","id":"关联方交易与转让定价的估价衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"关联关系的法定界定与成交价格的可用性","id":"关联关系的法定界定与成交价格的可用性"},{"level":2,"text":"「情形检验」到底看什么：把转让定价文档翻译成海关证据","id":"情形检验-到底看什么-把转让定价文档翻译成海关证据"},{"level":2,"text":"测试价格与二次检验：可复算的量化门槛","id":"测试价格与二次检验-可复算的量化门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"中国的衔接路径：213 号令、价格预裁定与同期资料","id":"中国的衔接路径-213-号令-价格预裁定与同期资料"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可执行的对账模型","id":"一个可执行的对账模型"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与操作清单","id":"常见误区与操作清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特许权使用费应税性认定与分摊方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/customs-valuation-mechanism/royalty-dutiability-apportionment"},"next":{"title":"特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/royalty-system-operations/royalty-calculation-engine"}}